fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloud_map;" vertex="1" parent="eks"><mxGeometry x="480" y="80" width="78" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="flow" value="모델 등록 흐름&lt;br&gt;1. 워크플로/파이프라인 출력이 READY 데이터셋으로 게시 (고정 manifest · VersionId)&lt;br&gt;2. 모델·평가 화면에서 checkpoint 파일 선택 → POST /api/models (생산 태스크 SUCCEEDED · receipts 검증)&lt;br&gt;3. evaluation.json 연결 → POST /api/evaluations (S3 HeadObject ChecksumMode) · 영상/보고서는 presigned 302&lt;br&gt;4. 품질 게이트(최소 회차 20 · 성공률 80% · p95 100ms 기본) 확인 → 승인 → 파이프라인 연동 모델이면 Registry 승인 전파" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A6C86;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="cloud"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="1060" width="1000" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mlflow_rules" value="실험 비교: 실험 이름 pai/&amp;lt;projectId&amp;gt;/… 와 run 태그 pai.project_id 로 프로젝트 격리 · 최대 4개 run 학습 곡선/파라미터 비교 · 'MLflow 열기'는 관리자 presigned URL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A6C86;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="cloud"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="1260" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="web"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="의도(intent) 기록 · 모델/평가 레코드" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=