2;" vertex="1" parent="vpc"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="1020" width="78" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ctrl" value="controller 워커: 만료 세션 정리 · DCV 세션 정리 · DCV 설정 reconcile (5초) · 워크플로 취소 시 세션 회수" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A6C86;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="vpc"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="1180" width="600" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note0" value="DCV 임베드: gateway 가 DCV 응답의 X-Frame-Options 를 제거하고 CSP frame-ancestors 'self' &amp;lt;대시보드 origin&amp;gt; 으로 교체 (kind=dcv 세션에만). '여기서 보기' 는 iframe, '새 창에서 열기' 는 새 탭.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;실시간 보기: 태스크 YAML live: true → MJPEG 사이드카 → port-forward 세션 → 실행 상세 iframe. 실행 소유자·RUNNING 태스크에서만." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#37475A;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1470" width="2100" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="DNS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="r53"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="HTTPS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="alb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="/api/sessions" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryD