ery_range&lt;br&gt;SigV4 service=aps · 허용된 PromQL 빌더만" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.managed_service_for_prometheus;" vertex="1" parent="cloud"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="1000" width="78" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cw" value="CloudWatch Logs&lt;br&gt;/aws/sagemaker/Clusters/&amp;lt;cluster&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;(리소스 스트립 링크)" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloudwatch;" vertex="1" parent="cloud"><mxGeometry x="560" y="1000" width="78" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scale" value="노드 수 변경(관리자) 흐름: snapshot(DescribeCluster + 노드/Pod + DynamoDB 활동 스캔 + SSAR) → 차단 사유(pods_active · workflows_active · sessions_active · policy_missing …)&lt;br&gt;→ 정책 저장(min/baseline/idle) → 계획 생성(5분 TTL) → 실행: 임대 획득 → cordon → 재검사 → BatchDeleteClusterNodes/UpdateCluster → 관찰(reconcile) SUCCEEDED/PARTIAL/FAILED. 유휴 자동 축소는 기본 비활성(워커 60초)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A6C86;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="cloud"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="800" width="1160" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="metrics" value="메트릭 탭: GPU(DCGM util/mem/power/temp) · 노드(node_exporter, 관리자) 또는 Pod(cAdvisor,