" y="440" width="960" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="usage" value="사용량 계산: task ledger·runtime 기록 기반 실행별 요청 CPU/GPU 시간(replica 시간 × 요청 자원). 타이밍·리소스 기록이 없으면 null(추정하지 않음).&lt;br&gt;실제 이용률·청구액 아님 · 단가/비용 산출 없음. 홈/관리 패널의 '계정 전체 비용' 은 Cost Explorer 값(관리자 전용)으로, 대시보드 외 서비스(EC2 · Bedrock 등) 포함." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A6C86;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="cloud"><mxGeometry x="500" y="860" width="1560" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="web"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="presigned GET/PUT 직접 전송" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#7AA116;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="s3a"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="List · Head · presign · Delete" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="web" target="s3a"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#F5F5F5;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" so